9,A grammar of modern indo-european,https://indo-european.info/indo-european-grammar.html,"Late Indo-European had at least two main inner dialectal branches, the Southern or Graeco-Aryan (S.LIE) and the Northern (N.LIE) ones.1.7.2. Southern Indo-European Dialects. Description: Description: Ancient Greek dialects by 400 BC after R.D. Woodard (2004).","Kurdish, Southern",Indo-European
